{{!< default}}
{{!--
    Individual conflict page — /commentarii-mundi/ukraine/

    Rendered as the index of a routes.yaml collection:

      /commentarii-mundi/ukraine/:
        permalink: /commentarii-mundi/ukraine/{slug}/
        template: cm-conflict
        data: tag.ukraine
        filter: tag:hash-commentarii-mundi+tag:ukraine

    A collection, because reports must live under their conflict at
    /commentarii-mundi/ukraine/{slug}/. Historia Arcana's own posts stay in the
    root collection and keep their URLs.

    This page is the landing page with conflict data: same hero, same filters, same
    feed, same sidebar. Chronologie and Regionen are appended below the feed, since
    they only exist at the conflict level.

    The feed carries Source's .gh-feed class so the theme's existing infinite-scroll
    pagination works here with no extra JavaScript.
--}}

{{!-- Master switch: the CM layout renders only while the page with slug
     "commentarii-mundi" is published. Otherwise this route falls back to Source's
     ordinary archive (see docs/commentarii-mundi.md §2). --}}
{{#get "pages" filter="slug:commentarii-mundi" fields="id" limit="1" as |cmHome|}}
    {{#if cmHome}}
        {{> "commentarii-mundi/page-conflict" ../this}}
    {{else}}
        {{> "commentarii-mundi/archive-fallback" ../this}}
    {{/if}}
{{/get}}
